  m_Name: BountyTutorial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Entries:
  - content: 'The frog-with-a-crown now deemed the ''Princess Frog'' has set up camps
      that need to be cleared so that mining can commence! We need your help '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a9924d74021fb49d796b34e9cd8d18a3, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: In this segment of the game, clear bounties to progress Jackie and Ives'
      story arc and unlock new enemy Actions you can play during combat.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b64e232132ef228439856328530fa3c8, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 'Let''s select a bounty by [Clicking] on it. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b64e232132ef228439856328530fa3c8, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
